      "So when his phone rang on a quiet Thursday afternoon and an unfamiliar number appeared on the screen, his first instinct was to let it go to voicemail. But something made him answer. \"Hello, is this Tomás? This is Rachel, from Northline Studios. I found your portfolio online and I love your work. Do you have a few minutes to talk?\"",
