      "\"It shows,\" Rachel said. \"Would you be available for a video call tomorrow with our creative director? It's a bigger conversation, more details about the project and the budget.\" Tomás felt a flicker of panic. A phone call was manageable — he could pace, think, take his time. A video call, live, with a creative director, felt like an entirely different level of pressure.",
